      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Lawn mowing approximates 4 to 6 METs and may evoke heart rate and systolic blood pressure responses that approach and exceed those attained during maximal exercise testing. The excessive cardiac demands may be deceptively camouflaged by the moderate aerobic requirements and perceived effort."},
